OS-UEFI-XHCI-DIRECT-STAGE2-V1
role = destructively reinitialize xHCI and prove independent command/event ring ownership
target = OVMF + QEMU q35 + qemu-xhci + usb-audio
depends-on = OS-UEFI-XHCI-DIRECT-STAGE1-V1
required = discover xHCI PCI class 0c:03:30
required = stop controller and observe HCHalted
required = HCRST completes
required = Controller Not Ready clears
required = configure one slot
required = program DCBAAP
required = program command ring with RCS=1
required = program event ring segment table and event ring
required = restart controller
required = preserve/recover connected USB Audio root port
required = issue Enable Slot command directly
required = receive Command Completion Event
required = completion code Success
required = nonzero Slot ID
claim = PASS proves direct xHCI takeover through MMIO and DMA rings under the tested OVMF/QEMU configuration
claim = PASS does not yet Address Device
claim = PASS does not yet configure USB Audio endpoint 1
claim = PASS does not yet transmit an Isoch TRB
physical-hardware = not-established
proof = pending
